        "id": 8341
      },
      "writtenOn": "2024-10-02T18:26:56Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "WDYT about just asserting that `imageToDraw-\u003ealphaType() \u003d\u003d kUnpremul_SkAlphaType` to simplify this case and the logic in the `else` branch?\n\nWe know it\u0027s an `Image_YUVA_Graphite` to get to this code path, so if something has changed its fixed alpha type we\u0027d maybe be needing to revisit this logic anyways?",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 1859,
        "startChar": 12,
        "endLine": 1859,
        "endChar": 61
      },
      "revId": "4603f30cfca2ed9c8a22ceb16ef6b64e57fbcd7f",
      "serverId": "5086850b-e599-37d2-8ec8-ff16aeccbf02"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "d1486508_0a01ddca",
        "filename": "src/gpu/graphite/KeyHelpers.cpp",
